You cant blank mail scrolls.  You cant polymorph mail scrolls.
Reading a mail scroll just invokes your mail reader, the only affect on
your mail is what you do when inside the mailreader, ie. your mail will
never be destroyed.

And if you get a mail scroll, save, read mail, and reenter game, reading
the scroll of mail will have the same affect as invoking 'mail' again ->
nothing.  Yuoll just have to hit enter to return to the game.

